# ─── Email notifications (Gmail SMTP — interim until custom domain) ─────
# 1. Turn on 2-Step Verification on the Gmail account you want to send from
# 2. Generate an App Password: myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Paste that 16-character password below (NOT your normal Gmail password)
# Leave unset to disable email notifications — the backend no-ops instead of failing.
GMAIL_USER=your-address@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password
